    "title": "File creation ownership in iiWebServer",
    "role": "guide",
    "authority": "markdown_source"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b000001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# File creation ownership in iiWebServer\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "File creation ownership in iiWebServer"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 3,
      "raw": "Confined uploads, streaming transfer output and platform file-share creation use provider-owned native descriptors/devices. Server routing, TLS, grants and transport validation remain here.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 4,
      "end_line": 4,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 9,
      "raw": "The Python TLS FTP host supplies `ProviderFilesystem` to pyftpdlib. STOR/APPE,\nSTOU temporary files, MKD and rename operations use the common native-backed\nprovider. Build and installed runtime directories carry the adapter, native\nshared library and notices. External rclone processes remain delegated protocol\nengines; their internals are outside the repository source factory audit.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 10,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 11,
      "end_line": 14,
      "raw": "The common [ownership contract](../../iiFileProvider/docs/FILE_OWNERSHIP.md) defines stream, staging, control-file and\ninstalled-package rules. Source regression tests remain with this module; the\nworkspace creation audit also checks these boundaries. Build/deployment and target\nruntime validation are separate evidence.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000008",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 15,
      "end_line": 15,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 16,
      "end_line": 16,
      "raw": "Changed boundaries:\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000010",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 17,
      "end_line": 18,
